    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Exercises AckWaiter backoff on MAV_RESULT_TEMPORARILY_REJECTED. PX4 DO_SET_MODE with HEARTBEAT-packed custom_mode 196608 returns (1) on this SIH image; the node retries until maxRetries is exhausted.",
